{
  "_doc": [
    "F-07 confirmed item detail rules (SGODOT-207 comment 168a4cc3, revisions 1-2; product wording 25f3cb4c; K-3 = A).",
    "Keys are kind/context. Kinds: seed crop fish dish bait rod material. Contexts: bag gear counter_buy counter_sell gift.",
    "A kind/context without an entry shows no card (cooking picks never show one).",
    "facts: lines in order (count and source, use, cost, XP hint); {token} values come from P0ItemInfo.tokens(); a line whose",
    "  tokens are empty is dropped. when: a predicate expression over P0ItemInfo.flags() (names, !, &), empty = always.",
    "buttons: in order; hidden unless `when` holds; `unless` lists unavailable states, the first one that holds replaces the",
    "  button with a grey reason (kind unavailable). kind: primary, secondary, nav (Gift ›). Never-possible actions have no",
    "  entry at all (no grey text: seeds and bait are never sold).",
    "promote: the button id that becomes primary when its own `when` holds, demoting the default primary (Deliver over Eat).",
    "lock: the title-area lock icon is shown; price: the buy row has a price column; quota: the sell area shows the quota line.",
    "Capability flags (can_store, can_lock, can_gift) gate actions the P0 server can't do yet: no button and no grey text until the view carries the feature (storage, locked on bag stacks, residents / social).",
    "Rarity and dish stars sit on the card's state line (spec.rarity_text, spec.quality), not in facts."
  ],
